      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Peter Easton, once a loyal English seaman, turned to piracy in 1604 and is still celebrated in Harbour Grace lore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
